Symptom: the 'orders today' report shows yesterday's late-evening orders, but only for users in UTC-5. Reproduce: as a user with timezone America/New_York, place an order at 21:00 local, then open the report the next morning. Observed in production. Changed recently: the report query was rewritten last sprint; the cache config has not changed in a year.

```js
function ordersToday(orders, now = new Date()) {
  const today = now.toISOString().slice(0, 10)
  return orders.filter(o => o.createdAt.toISOString().slice(0, 10) === today)
}
```

Symptom: GET /teams/:id/members times out (30s) for the 'Platform' team, which has 4,000 members. Small teams return in under a second.
Reproduce: GET /teams/42/members. Observed in production. Changed recently: member avatars were added last week.

```js
app.get('/teams/:id/members', async (req, res) => {
  const members = await db.query('SELECT * FROM members WHERE team_id = $1', [req.params.id])
  for (const m of members) {
    m.avatar = await db.query('SELECT url FROM avatars WHERE member_id = $1', [m.id])
  }
  res.json(members)
})
```
